As of September 30, 2025, and without giving effect to subsequent capital raises in October and December 2025, our cash and cash equivalents were approximately $4.3 million and we had an accumulated deficit of approximately $238.8 million. The amount and timing of our future funding requirements will depend on many factors, some of which are outside of our control, including but not limited to:

